@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BorderColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A67C00
title Ofgem price-cap import foundation
participant OfgemPriceCapImportService as Service
participant HttpDataDownloader as Downloader
participant OfgemPriceCapWorkbookExtractor as Extractor
participant OfgemPriceCapRepository as Repository
Service -> Downloader : obtain discovered workbook
Downloader --> Service : DownloadResult
Service -> Extractor : extract workbook
Extractor --> Service : OfgemPriceCapWorkbookData
Service -> Repository : upsert period and replace facts
Repository --> Service : OfgemImportResult
note over Service
The service and repository exist, but the configured
com.towermarsh.opendata.plugin.ofgem.OfgemPlugin
implementation is not present in this source baseline.
end note
@enduml
